  "invariants": [
    "Every case preserves expectedPages.total/IDs/order/scores/paging from corpus.json; preview counts never replace page totals.",
    "selectedAnchors are in lexical field, valueIndex, start, end, anchor order, not density, heading label, input-array order or score order.",
    "Each small excerpt is the exact sourceSlices text; highlights are section-relative original UTF-16 coordinates.",
    "Repeated heading labels remain distinct anchors; raw anchor percent/hash characters are encoded exactly once.",
    "omittedMatchingAnchors lists only known qualifying descriptors omitted for this displayed page; it is not a global matching-section total.",
    "A page qualifies across source sections or fields without any claim that one preview satisfies every page-level query clause.",
    "Identical original coordinates in different fields or values cannot be joined, deduplicated or clipped across boundaries."
  ]
